[
    {
        "TextId": 1,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "There's a menu posted here. Burgers, meat buns, desserts... and \"Victory Chips\"? What are those?",
        "Cv": 510029029.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 2,
        "ActorName": "Vanessa",
        "ActorTalk": "Ugh, this menu is ancient. How is this place still in business, peddling the same old nonsense?",
        "Cv": 510029030.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 3,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "But what makes these chips special?",
        "Cv": 510029031.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": "Vanessa",
        "ActorTalk": "They're just ordinary salted chips wrapped in a childish superstition. Legend says eating them before a test guarantees success.",
        "Cv": 510029032.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Vanessa",
        "ActorTalk": "A ridiculous notion. If snacks could earn you a degree, we wouldn't have all those bookworms burying their heads in textbooks.",
        "Cv": 510029033.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "That does sound far-fetched. What about you, Commandant? Have you ever tried them?",
        "Cv": 510029034.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "Vanessa",
        "ActorTalk": "You've got to be kidding me. You actually fell for that marketing scam?",
        "Cv": 510029035.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": "Vanessa",
        "ActorTalk": "Wait... So that contest was...",
        "Cv": 510029036.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "Vanessa?",
        "Cv": 510029037.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": "Vanessa",
        "ActorTalk": "...Never mind. It's irrelevant. The chips are a placebo at best.",
        "Cv": 510029038.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "I see...",
        "Cv": 510029039.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "I was only thinking that if you like them, Commandant, I could attempt to recreate them back at the quarters.",
        "Cv": 510029040.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "Of course. Another time.",
        "Cv": 510029041.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "Then it's settled. We can gather the necessary ingredients after the ceremony, Commandant.",
        "Cv": 510029042.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 15,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Yes.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 16,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "No, can't say I have.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 17,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Another time, perhaps.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 18,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "We can give it a try.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    }
]